{"parse": {"title": "以骑士之名-04", "pageid": 127814, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D-03\" title=\"以骑士之名-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">以骑士之名-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D-05\" title=\"以骑士之名-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">以骑士之名</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.AC.AC.E4.BA.8C.E5.A0.82.E8.AF.BE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"第二堂课\">第二堂课</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 第二堂课</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Second Lesson</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_04.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_04\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_04\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-3_3_bg_04.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_04.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-3_3_bg_04.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_04.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d9/Cg-3_3_bg_04.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_04.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>两位骑士脚步不停，在夜幕降临时抵达了雷约瓦镇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们并未进入镇中心，而是在镇郊落了脚。郊外人烟稀少，荒废已久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>以重塑之手的速度，明天同一时间就会抵达这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>进入城镇的路口狭窄，他们被迫减速，我们可以借助夜色伏击他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德勘察了一番周遭的环境，指了指面前贯穿小镇唯一的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这附近的房屋已无人居住，但还保留着民众离开前的用具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>今晚我们可以借用这间屋子过夜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱走向身后的空屋，仔细打量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>屋檐下，风干的荨麻与蓍草串摇摆着，玛尔纱摸了摸，轻轻掸去干草串上的尘土。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>基金会允许你就这么跟着我走吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这也属于任务的一部分，我已告知了长官和“剃刀”先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沉默又一次倏然臌胀在二人之间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……玛尔纱，我很庆幸你活了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>但我不明白，你为什么没有尝试与骑士团联系，又为什么选择违背自己的誓言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>绝不擅自离团，绝不擅自加入其他组织——在正式成为骑士的那一天，玛尔纱郑重承诺过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>质疑无可避免地来临了，但阿德海德的反应已比她设想的要温和太多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……我不愿再作为一个士兵去夺走另一个士兵的性命了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我所追寻的骑士之路，不该是在焦黑的战场上不断杀戮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>如果重回骑士团，我将不会有任何其他选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>绝对忠诚于骑士团，从不过问骑士团的任何决策，是所有骑士接受训练时铭记在心的原则。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也是誓言之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我同基金会打过交道，也承认他们的人做了些好事，但他们同样也开始征召来自不同国家的军人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>基金会并非国家政体，却能拥有自己的军队，更不受任何国家的监督，甚至可以肆意游走其中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>基金会的危险程度并不亚于重塑之手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……我不否认这一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>但我还是愿意相信在我加入之后亲身经历的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>至少我能在基金会成为一名医生，在前线救治伤员，这是之前我难以拥有的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德，我能做的事，比以往更多了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>骑士团从未有过这样的先例。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱并不急于在此刻说服阿德海德，她想到了更重要的事，一份愿景已呼之欲出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德，我从来没有放弃过自己的“骑士”身份。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>如今骑士团前路未明，我也同样忧虑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你是怎么想的，阿德海德？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德思忖了片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>夺回财宝后，我会前去寻找散落在各地的骑士团成员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>未来的路，之后会慢慢厘清。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>当然我并不赞同部分成员想要建立骑士王国的想法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱捕捉到了阿德海德难以隐藏的迷茫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德，我有一个想法，你愿意听听吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我希望骑士团能重组为一个无国界医疗救援组织。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>让骑士们从杀戮之中解放出来，回到骑士团的初心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德愣了愣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……这个想法同样也是不合时宜的，玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>意料之中的拒绝。玛尔纱抿了抿嘴，并未选择放弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这是我深思熟虑后的想法，阿德海德。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>跟随医疗救援小组一起行动、在前线作为医生抢救伤患的日子里，我总是会想起你以往的教导。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>——骑士团成立的初衷，就是在战争中救援受伤与病重的人们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德沉默良久，最终她只是转身，推门走进了身后的屋子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531804.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>时间不早了，养好精神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱站在门外，抬起头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>云层低矮，如同一只巨人的手掌，将人与万物牢牢攥在手心里，别无他处可去。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_13\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/Cg-s01_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312724.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312724.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312724.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312724.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312724.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312724.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312724.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312724.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一瘸一拐地走进城堡，巨大的廊柱之下，她的身影显得渺小。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着另一道阴影也将她笼罩，她被彻底吞没在交错的倒影之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312724.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312724.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312724.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312724.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312724.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312724.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312724.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312724.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的骑士表情严肃，她似乎已在这里等候多时。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我旁观了你今天的骑士训练。在小队撤离时，你选择独自一人留下来，阻挡追兵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312726.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-312726.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312726.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312726.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-312726.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312726.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-312726.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312726.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>为什么会做出这样的判断？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312724.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312724.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312724.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312724.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312724.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312724.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-312724.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312724.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>撤退队伍里有伤员，必须有人争取时间，否则会全军覆没。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>所以，你认为如果牺牲你一人，但能保证小队撤退成功就算任务目标达成了，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312726.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-312726.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312726.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312726.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-312726.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312726.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ac/HeadIconSmall-312726.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312726.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>最后你争取到时间了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312728.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-312728.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312728.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312728.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-312728.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312728.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-312728.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312728.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……没有。在我“死”后，追兵很快追上了小队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在被“追兵”用一根长矛刺中腿后，她被判定“死亡”，她的训练就此草草结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>一个人留下来，在没有任何地形掩护的情况下，只是白白送命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱一时哑然，但她握紧了拳头，为自己辩解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312725.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312725.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312725.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312725.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312725.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312725.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312725.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312725.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>今天我们的撤离路线有问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312725.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312725.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312725.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312725.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312725.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312725.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312725.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312725.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>如果能从另一侧山路撤离，那里山口狭窄，那么我的断后是能够争取到足够时间的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312725.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312725.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312725.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312725.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312725.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312725.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-312725.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312725.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>骑士……也不该畏惧牺牲自己的生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱直视着阿德海德，嘴角抿成倔强的一条线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……如果未来你根本没有其他路线选择呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>玛尔纱，我了解你，你还会做出和今日一样的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>不仅是今天，过往多次训练里，你都表现得同样鲁莽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>在经验不足的情况下自告奋勇去冲撞“敌人”的木门，协同进攻时总是先行举盾冲入“敌军”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>你的勇气，是时刻为了“骑士的牺牲”而准备的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德放缓了语气，甚至夹杂着些许无奈的叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我知道……你渴望用一场壮烈的“牺牲”来确证自己的意义——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>你不再是当年那个被父母遗弃在雪地里、没有价值的小孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>而是像英勇的骑士那样，是值得让人铭记的战士，对吗，玛尔纱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱愣怔着，面上烧了起来，内心深处的愿景已被老练的骑士一览无余。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312728.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-312728.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312728.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312728.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-312728.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312728.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1c/HeadIconSmall-312728.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312728.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我……不否认。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>但这样不是真正的勇敢，玛尔纱。这只是有勇无谋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德转身，示意玛尔纱跟上来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312730.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-312730.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312730.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312730.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-312730.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312730.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-312730.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312730.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德，我们要去哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>脚步声回荡在空旷的走廊里，时光也显得稀薄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我要教会你除了勇敢之外，另一件重要的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312730.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-312730.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312730.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312730.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-312730.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312730.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/HeadIconSmall-312730.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312730.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>珍惜生命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>过于冒进，不仅浪费了你的勇气，还有可能会牵连同伴，致使他们也陷入危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>玛尔纱，你知道高地骑士团最初为什么会成立吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312729.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-312729.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312729.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312729.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-312729.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312729.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/HeadIconSmall-312729.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312729.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你说过，是为了救助当年在远征途中无人医治的同胞而诞生的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>没错，我想今天得更详细地教给你这段历史了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德停下了脚步，缓缓推开了身后藏书室的门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黢黑的室内，玛尔纱侧耳聆听着。她再次从梦中抽身，是屋内窸窣的声响惊醒了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>深夜，有人潜入了这间屋子，正小心翻找着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她睁开眼，身边的阿德海德也已清醒。她们默契地假装沉睡，等待图谋不轨的人接近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……该死，这里也没有……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>嘘，别惊动她们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>属于两个人的声音。他们压低了声音说话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接着，他们蹑手蹑脚地靠近了。骑士们的头顶上方，有一个柜子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们的目标也许正是这个柜子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>如果这里也没有，那我们便赶紧返程——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>唔！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天旋地转中，男人惊惧地意识到自己已被制服在地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他艰难地侧过头，发现身边的同伴则被一把手枪抵在头上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>等等——我们没有恶意……该死！我们只是来找药的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红发女性抓着他的手越发收紧了力道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312721.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/HeadIconSmall-312721.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312721.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312721.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/HeadIconSmall-312721.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312721.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/HeadIconSmall-312721.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312721.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>找药？你们是谁？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "以骑士之名-04"}}